ek one i would assume  and uh you know i guess the the other  fallout is this possibly buys enough  time for john williams to make the  roster as their backup boundary  cornerback jeff howe thank you for the  time what a day what a day we'll catch  up down the line appreciate it all right  thanks rich jeff fowler the athletic  hey you watched all the way to the end  thanks for that watch more right here

